        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026630/extras/d7992ec9dcf24940293d80fae11139e3.webp?t=1759219833\" width=111 height=52 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist wakes up without remembering anything about her life. Your objective in the adventure will be to remember what you did to lose it, and who knows... Maybe you will discover the dark secrets of humanity that SHE don't want you to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026630/extras/234e79f78820c5660e4f88a64a0f7f99.webp?t=1759219833\" width=132 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blaster Bunny Sacrilege is the third and last game of &quot;The Princess Trilogy&quot;, a metroidvania action platform game, you have to explore new worlds, discover secret places, defeat bosses and unravel the secrets of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026630/extras/0a3d8254846496fef0957272be37aa7d.webp?t=1759219833\" width=490 height=29 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026630/extras/be29354457d72aff752949388480d001.webp?t=1759219833\" width=178 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 Worlds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 Bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Difficulties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 Languages (English and Spanish).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 Ending, the official ending of &quot;The Princess Trilogy&quot;.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4026630/extras/57c20151e0baf7dbc5dab9b20b683480.webp?t=1759219833\" width=228 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soundtrack was created by <strong>Sweep Blast Studios</strong>.</p>",
